 s://www.waspaa.com/waspaa25/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venu
 e-radar/#waspaa-2025\nNotes: Archived official pages confirm Granlibakken
  Tahoe Resort\, Tahoe City\, Oct 12-15\, 2025\, fully in-person and the f
 irst WASPAA away from Mohonk Mountain House. All deadlines were 23:59 AoE
