 nStatus: confirmed\, checked 2026-10-31\nPrevious edition's page: https:/
 /2026.neurolang.org/future-meetings/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github
 .io/venue-radar/#snl-2027\nNotes: SNL's future-meetings and home pages co
 nfirm SNL 2027 in Hong Kong\, September 24-27\, 2027\; no 2027 site\, ven
 ue or call yet. Both deadlines are proxies from SNL 2026 shifted 360 days
  with the meeting start. Symposia were due March 25 and abstracts May 22\
 , 2026 as first published (extended to May 26)\, end of day in the latest
  time zone on Earth. Abstract first authors and symposium organizers must
  be SNL members\; the 2026 fee was $40. Abstracts are peer-reviewed and p
 rinted in the program\; there are no paper proceedings. Size from 643 pos
 ters at SNL 2026 (first authors present)\; attendance is not published. S
 ize is an editorial estimate.
